description = "Used as hydraulic fluid, processed into fuel, or as a lubricant for mechanisms, oil is a vitally important fluid for all SAV activities and parts. Engines, jerry cans, oil drums and transformers give it up. Used in hydraulics, thrusters and coolant systems."
